{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は東京ビックサイト、今日はパシフィコ横浜で握手会してたよー(^O^)／✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は朝起きて適当に服着たら真っ黒でモードな感じになった笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanami.hashimoto/img/0000-70.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"赤リップ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanami.hashimoto/img/0001-64.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は誕生日近いこともあって、たくさんの人に\n少し早い誕生日おめでとうの言葉をたくさんもらったよー！\nありがとうー(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同じ誕生日のまりかと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanami.hashimoto/img/0002-50.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"22歳と19歳のポーズ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いこまちゃんがデュラララ‼︎の臨也のコスしてた！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanami.hashimoto/img/0003-38.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の顔はうつせる表情してなかったから片目でご勘弁を、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度いこまちゃんに紀田くんのコスプレをお願いした！\n圧倒的紀田くん派なのです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもデュラララ撮り溜めててまだ二期全然観れてないよ、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"四月は君の嘘はまだ最新話観れてないよ、、\n最終巻絶対買う、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしたもがんばるぞー！！"}],"source":"archive"}